title: "EEG Feature Pipeline: BIDS-Native Preprocessing, Feature Extraction, and Reliability Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A BIDS-native Python pipeline for resting-state EEG preprocessing,
  neurophysiological feature extraction, sensor-space functional connectivity,
  within-recording feature stability, preprocessing sensitivity analysis, and
  quality-control reporting.
